; TRUNCATED_FELL_BACK_TO_TCP, with both sides of the boundary pinned.
;
; A response is truncated when it exceeds min(client-advertised EDNS buffer,
; server maximum). The reliable lever is the *client*: a query carrying no OPT
; record is capped at 512 bytes by protocol, independent of server tuning.
;
; Measured, not assumed — the first draft of this fixture was wrong. A 2048-bit
; DKIM key is ~410 bytes of rdata, which makes a 483-byte response: under 512,
; so it does NOT truncate. Both records below are kept deliberately, because a
; verifier that reports truncation for the 2048-bit case is as broken as one
; that misses it for the 4096-bit case.
;
; Debugging gotcha worth knowing: `dig` silently retries over TCP when it sees
; TC and prints the *retried* answer, so the tc flag never appears. Use
; `dig +ignore` to observe the real UDP response.
;
; Payload sizes avoid the ~1200-4096 byte band where IP fragmentation kicks in.
; Fragmented UDP is a known flakiness source, and a second reason this topology
; uses host networking and skips docker-proxy.
$ORIGIN tcp.test.
$TTL 300

@       IN SOA  ns1.test. hostmaster.propgate.invalid. (
                1 7200 3600 1209600 300 )
@       IN NS   ns1.test.

; Real 2048-bit RSA key. 483-byte response — fits in 512, must NOT be
; reported as truncated. The control for this fixture.
big._domainkey  IN TXT ( "v=DKIM1; k=rsa; p=MIIBIjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAAOCAQ8AMIIBCgKCAQEA3jIqphyDocBm/6nl5TsUuK2MzHeCN2MqzSFiqlpSI3J07LJtyeDn2oPw0h9XTur+ivk2HK653fzYDPRWZX4tP6N1U5huKFnH/1YJSK0lkogPfuwiKxMpIIUtChT1dJBgHhlCa4l2gTABjB3cEZ/YinDEeWlMBRpEgank1uVDMNo4CIZoR6qU8fl1mJ7Wsx/oa"
                         "/PiD0gqDcduF5B4hhw6GpwMj5eWQ8WwFuN4GHnQz0JiMJPRhwwlG0jESt4ktEdNoG0LfaIcWp7r3uGxePo7cpVS0EscmCyyKBlArMyt1jdKssvXOUWDWX0kCSDX/K0Bw1JA87eAQeSU7ZvM331j6wIDAQAB" )

; Real 4096-bit RSA key, ~740 bytes of rdata. Exceeds 512, so a query with
; no OPT record gets TC and the resolver must retry over TCP. This is the
; realistic DKIM truncation case.
big4096._domainkey IN TXT ( "v=DKIM1; k=rsa; p=MIICIjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAAOCAg8AMIICCgKCAgEA5Pln849AOgM0f+Vqy07IdlBguqIwQ/Dfh/NGnjx7QyamNhlXvoi1328DR4iI2YVgduzHZ/O1G+NyLbVAtJh/7D3VoSxFGHPw7WabBP29ozUmEmBNF7bBn75EpQAfZHPPNj5+ZDdXBUPXhV2644r0h8CH/0d58o/ItyRO+qNtuBvz0zixkl64ia5TzHZlrto7l"
                            "j49xSBmL9wvOqhmMhQ4yB34a+uuilZ7UlVVzwyip7k6VInkDepl01kVYoOtUZB1Ck/XDt/Q5qRRN+Hlt11qC7K4GKtbxcoXMTiQfyZxERJ03H8DlMHHAAjAuXc/DcMZMyvdea3ra5ajov7C175012H0jXNdduJ6dFov+S5Y3WqntG/7PvRL8iv9na8hB0WHtaQOgir1JbDpAfjR1WDFQ535/aUHXeOcifrTIU1fGSec2AD2ke8Q79pn3Aq/Rc9Y"
                            "nJIukw5g7B7HVv4puL2/GeA2kCl8Isr82wojlVnudmAaJAgEY0lgvhkzzlHTUdmn8LOLbWkjEpvJ1fGVsWWD1AxiWj+sxxy7OycoFbwsNie6XXqG16oG44ihJ2+h6J8KpHW7T9haMTbbRXQLht/ut7FLR2oLfG3PLH/nWRwRULoYM/vXd0PhSHl4G1hrrkiiyXh9BoENShi+HhJOO0riGJ2hy3E4RY/rlf+RSHdn9RECAwEAAQ==" )

; 17 x 255 bytes in a single rdata: truncated even at an advertised 4096.
huge            IN TXT ( "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
                         "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
